						 <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <div class="anom-bar-container item-5156 clear-2 euclid none vlam warning {$american}"> <div class="anom-bar"> <div class="top-box"> <div class="top-left-box"><span class="item">Item#:</span> <span class="number">5156</span></div> <div class="top-center-box"> <div class="bar-one"></div> <div class="bar-two"></div> <div class="bar-three"></div> <div class="bar-four"></div> <div class="bar-five"></div> <div class="bar-six"></div> </div> <div class="top-right-box"> <div class="level">Level2</div> <div class="clearance"></div> </div> </div> <div class="bottom-box"> <div class="text-part"> <div class="main-class"> <div class="contain-class"> <div class="class-category">Containment Class:</div> <div class="class-text">euclid</div> </div> <div class="second-class"> <div class="class-category">Secondary Class:</div> <div class="class-text">none</div> </div> </div> <div class="disrupt-class"> <div class="class-category">Disruption Class:</div> <div class="class-text">vlam</div> </div> <div class="risk-class"> <div class="class-category">Risk Class:</div> <div class="class-text">warning</div> </div> </div> <div class="diamond-part"> <div class="danger-diamond"><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/classification-committee-memo">link to memo</a><br /> <div class="arrows"></div> <div class="octagon"></div> <div class="quadrants"> <div class="top-quad"></div> <div class="right-quad"></div> <div class="left-quad"></div> <div class="bottom-quad"></div> </div> <div class="top-icon"></div> <div class="right-icon"></div> <div class="left-icon"></div> <div class="bottom-icon"></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="scp-image-block block-right" style="width:32;"><img src="https://live.staticflickr.com/3068/2768392379_3a4cb975ce_b.jpg" style="width:32;" alt="2768392379_3a4cb975ce_b.jpg" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:32;"> <p>SCP-5156 inside a subjects body.</p> </div> </div> <p><strong>Special Containment Procedures:</strong> SCP-5156 is to be kept in a 1767.84 centimeters wide cell with special NORA security cameras and iron doors due to SCP-5156's exceptional strength.</p> <hr /> <p><strong>Description:</strong> SCP-5156 is a six foot tall humanoid that looks roughly like a king with white eyes.</p> <p>SCP-5156 is able to merge with anything granting it the body and/or powers due to it's virus.<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-552510-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >1</a></sup></p> <p>SCP-5156 can speak english, spanish, and french.</p> <p>SCP-5156 is very intelligent and is able to learn very quickly.</p> <p>SCP-5156 can't attack the person they morph into due to being in the body and if the body SCP-5156 is in gets destroyed so does SCP-5156.</p> <hr /> <p><strong>Discovery:</strong> SCP-5156 was first discovered on 11/██/███ in a factory at ██████ and was found by J████ B████ during a security search at the █████ factory. SCP-5156 was trying to attack J████ B████ due to unknows reasons. SCP-5156 was in a 6 foot box when found for unknown reasons.</p> <hr /> <p><strong>Addendum.6467.1:</strong> Due to SCP-5156's ability to speak our researchers were able to get a interview with SCP-5156</p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Interview&nbsp;log</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Close&nbsp;interview</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div class="blockquote"> <p><strong>Interviewed:</strong> SCP-5156</p> <p><strong>Interviewer:</strong> ██████</p> <p><strong>Foreword:</strong> The point of the interview is to find out why SCP-5156 was in a box.</p> <p><strong>&lt;Begin Log&gt;</strong></p> <p><strong>██████:</strong> Hello SCP-5156 today you are here so we can find out why you were in a box got it?</p> <p><strong>SCP-5156:</strong> Got it.</p> <p><strong>██████:</strong> So first question why were you in a factory?</p> <p><strong>SCP-5156:</strong> Well it's because of my owner.</p> <p><strong>██████:</strong> Who is this &quot;owner&quot;?</p> <p><strong>SCP-5156:</strong> Their name was █████████ ██████████ I think.</p> <p><strong>██████:</strong> Ok and now why were you in a box?</p> <p><strong>SCP-5156:</strong> Well once I got in the factory it was like she wanted to send me somewhere.</p> <p><strong>██████:</strong> So what happened after that?</p> <p>[SCP-5156 starts to look around the room]</p> <p><strong>SCP-5156:</strong> Well it was like I was in her body and after I was in I started to cause chaos since I felt betrayed.</p> <p><strong>██████:</strong> Yes so how did you get into the box?</p> <p><strong>SCP-5156:</strong> well I fell out of her body and into the box everybody said I was too dangerous and just kept me in there with the lid closed.</p> <p><strong>██████:</strong> Thank you for your time SCP-5156 you are free to go back to your room now.</p> <p><strong>&lt;End Log&gt;</strong></p> <p><strong>Closing Statement:</strong> After the interview SCP-5156 was taken back to it's cell and the research team started to see if they could get more information about █████████ ██████████ no progress has been achieved.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <hr /> <p><strong>Addendum.6467.2:</strong> To research SCP-5156's ability to morph into anything a test was preformed on D-34734.</p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Test&nbsp;log</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Close&nbsp;test&nbsp;log</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Test Number: 1/1</span></p> <blockquote> <p>Subject: D-34734<br /> Time: June 27th 4:43 PM EST<br /> <strong>Procedure:</strong> D-34734 was placed in SCP-5156's room with two guards near the door.<br /> <strong>Result:</strong> SCP-5156 went into D-34734's body as planned and started causing chaos. While the chaos happened a guard removed SCP-5156 from D-34734's body<br /> <strong>Analysis:</strong> SCP-5156 can cause chaos inside a body but it it very easy to stop.</p> </blockquote> </div> </div> </div> <div class="footnotes-footer"> <div class="title">Footnotes</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-552510-1"><a href="javascript:;" >1</a>. This doesn't happen a lot.</div> </div> <div class="footer-wikiwalk-nav"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p>&#171; <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5155">SCP-5155</a> | SCP-5156 | <a class="newpage" href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5157">SCP-5157</a> &#187;</p> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/luka-the-bigger" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6224712&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606445866" alt="Luka the bigger" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6224712)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/luka-the-bigger" >Luka the bigger</a></span></p> 
