						 <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <div class="anom-bar-container item-5314 clear-2 euclid none vlam warning {$american}"> <div class="anom-bar"> <div class="top-box"> <div class="top-left-box"><span class="item">Item#:</span> <span class="number">5314</span></div> <div class="top-center-box"> <div class="bar-one"></div> <div class="bar-two"></div> <div class="bar-three"></div> <div class="bar-four"></div> <div class="bar-five"></div> <div class="bar-six"></div> </div> <div class="top-right-box"> <div class="level">Level2</div> <div class="clearance"></div> </div> </div> <div class="bottom-box"> <div class="text-part"> <div class="main-class"> <div class="contain-class"> <div class="class-category">Containment Class:</div> <div class="class-text">euclid</div> </div> <div class="second-class"> <div class="class-category">Secondary Class:</div> <div class="class-text">none</div> </div> </div> <div class="disrupt-class"> <div class="class-category">Disruption Class:</div> <div class="class-text">vlam</div> </div> <div class="risk-class"> <div class="class-category">Risk Class:</div> <div class="class-text">warning</div> </div> </div> <div class="diamond-part"> <div class="danger-diamond"><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/classification-committee-memo">link to memo</a><br /> <div class="arrows"></div> <div class="octagon"></div> <div class="quadrants"> <div class="top-quad"></div> <div class="right-quad"></div> <div class="left-quad"></div> <div class="bottom-quad"></div> </div> <div class="top-icon"></div> <div class="right-icon"></div> <div class="left-icon"></div> <div class="bottom-icon"></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p><br /></p> <div class="scp-image-block block-right" style="width:300px;"><a href="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/scp-5314/Kip"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/scp-5314/Kip/medium.jpg" style="width:300px;" alt="Kip" class="image" /></a> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:300px;"> <p>A family of SCP-5314 instances</p> </div> </div> <p><strong>Special Containment Procedures:</strong> All SCP-5314 instances are contained in a medium-sized animal containment chamber at Site-66. The containment chamber must be observed at all times, to identify any anomalous events.</p> <p><strong>Description:</strong> SCP-5314 refers to 127 anomalous instances of <em>Gallus Gallus domesticus</em><sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-917531-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >1</a></sup> of the ''Leghorn&quot; race. SCP-5314 instances are sapient and demonstrate an ability to organize themselves as a society. All SCP-5314 instances follow the same religion and spend the majority of their time practicing it. Documents made by instances of SCP-5314 call it the ''Fellowship of the glorious egg''.</p> <p>SCP-5314 instances engage in the following daily activities:</p> <ul> <li>Praying, alone or in groups.</li> <li>Writing books. Stories vary in context but are usually about chickens that perform miracles.</li> <li>Building small temples to offer to Their deity.</li> <li>Worshipping several objects inside their containment unit.</li> </ul> <p>SCP-5314's religion revolves around an entity designated as the &quot;great egg god,&quot; otherwise classified as SCP-5314-A. Although SCP-5314-A hasn't been observed, It is theorized that the entity has the capability to interfere with instances of SCP-5314 and their surroundings using SCP-5314-◇; however, the extent of its interactions remains unknown.</p> <p>SCP-5314-◇ is the designation given to random events that can occur within the area populated by SCP-5314 instances. More observation is necessary in order to understand how SCP-5314-◇ manifests and its resulting effects on the SCP-5314 populace.</p> <hr /> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h2><span>Addendum 5314.1</span></h2> <h3><span><tt>SCP-5314-◇ events</tt></span></h3> </div> <hr /> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▶OPEN&nbsp;ADDENDUM◀</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▷CLOSE◁&nbsp;</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <table class="wiki-content-table"> <tr> <td><strong>Date</strong></td> <td><strong>Event</strong></td> <td><strong>Notes</strong></td> </tr> <tr> <td>2019/02/22</td> <td>Clouds manifested inside SCP-5314s' containment room. The cloud consisted primarily of urine.</td> <td>Event repeats itself every two weeks. SCP-5314 instances hold festivals with every event.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>2019/03/11</td> <td>A trash can manifested inside SCP-5314s' containment room. Inside of it were several textbooks and a yearbook titled ''Jehovas school for the godly, 2017-2018''</td> <td>Research into the contents is ongoing</td> </tr> <tr> <td>2019/03/28</td> <td>SCP-5314 instances are seen worshipping for their god. An egg manifests above the instances</td> <td>The egg is seemingly unbreakable, as SCP-5314 instances failed to catch it.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>2019/04/10</td> <td>SCP-5314 instances are seen bringing offers to the egg. A large paint bucket manifests above the egg, covering the location in a golden yellow tint.</td> <td>Around 44 SCP-5314 instances also turn yellow. Paint disappeared after about 3 months</td> </tr> <tr> <td>2019/04/18</td> <td>An SCP-5314 instance is born, as several SCP-5314 instances try to give gifts to the instance, several bolts of lightning strike the new-born instance.</td> <td>SCP-5314 instance miraculously survived</td> </tr> <tr> <td>2019/06/02</td> <td>Several SCP-5314 instances crucify another instance on a cross, made of scraps of SCP-5314 houses. Cross repeatedly falls over, until it breaks.</td> <td>SCP-5314 instances try to beat up the crucified instance before foundation personnel intervenes.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>2019/10/19</td> <td>Winged eggs manifest around a dead SCP-5314 instance's grave. As the eggs try to sing, loud hip-hop music starts playing. this continues until the eggs break.</td> <td>After this event, SCP-5314 instances have become highly sensitive to modern hip-hop music.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>2019/11/01</td> <td>A stop board manifests inside of the containment room. SCP-5314 instances start to worship it.</td> <td>No anomalous effects have happened since.</td> </tr> </table> </div> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/snom" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5953932&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606445870" alt="SNOM" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5953932)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/snom" >SNOM</a></span></p> <div class="footnotes-footer"> <div class="title">Footnotes</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-917531-1"><a href="javascript:;" >1</a>. Domesticated chicken</div> </div> 
