&lt;p&gt;The following is the author page of artist and author &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/barredowl&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6001754&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606445870&quot; alt=&quot;barredowl&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6001754)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/barredowl&quot;  &gt;barredowl&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; (who is currently on an indefinitely long hiatus), in which she has displayed some various pieces, pages, and art she has accrued over her time as a contributor to the SCP wiki. She sends a warm welcome to all who decide to visit, and wishes them a good day.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;#8212; Variella Strix, Director, SEMD&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div id=&quot;wiki-tabview-1a28da9760ff8908c5d9ada3c4e3be86&quot; class=&quot;yui-navset&quot;&gt;
