&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded-link&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;▷&amp;nbsp;COMMENTARY&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;My first page submitted to the wiki. Actually, before making this, I wasn&#039;t too experienced with pixel art, and was way more comfortable with just regular drawing. However, after I tried out some stuff with the &lt;a href=&quot;https://lospec.com/palette-list&quot;&gt;lospec palette list&lt;/a&gt;, I got a little more accustomed with using it to make art. A lot of the line art for the SCP drawings is a little rough, but other than that, I&#039;m satisfied with how the art turned out.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-folded&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;▶&amp;nbsp;COMMENTARY&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded&quot; style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;
