&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-folded&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;▶&amp;nbsp;COMMENTARY&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded&quot; style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded-link&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;▷&amp;nbsp;COMMENTARY&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Yeah, I only drew the picture for this, but it certainly was nice to be working with &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rjb-r&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1229263&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606445871&quot; alt=&quot;RJB_R&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1229263)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rjb-r&quot;  &gt;RJB_R&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;. I&#039;m actually not too familiar with the Technical Researcher Rosen character &amp;#8212; I was going for more of a 90&#039;s feel (i.e. the Amiga keyboard, the beige palette), so it was kind of a surprise to see that Rosen was supposedly employed in 2012. Anyway, it was a great honor to be working with Roget for the brief time I could.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Co-Author:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rjb-r&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1229263&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606445871&quot; alt=&quot;RJB_R&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1229263)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rjb-r&quot;  &gt;RJB_R&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
